  "body": "MOST SOLD. ONLY A FEW REMAIN.\r\n\r\nWith the majority of homes at Okahu Villas already sold, a new community has taken shape. Now there's an opportunity to become part of it, with just a few homes still available.\r\n\r\nModern, low-maintenance living in a well-connected location, with Auckland's Eastern Bays beaches, cafes, shops and recreational options all within easy reach. Whether you're looking for a home to enjoy now or a quality property for the future, 52C Tautari offers a practical balance of lifestyle, comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nHere's what makes it work:\r\n\r\n*  Three levels of flexible living - a practical layout for families, professionals, downsizers or those looking to share with flatmates and offset mortgage costs.\r\n*  Miele-equipped kitchen - connecting to open-plan living and dining, with seamless flow to a sunny, north-west-facing outdoor entertaining area.\r\n*  Three bedrooms upstairs - including a master suite with ensuite and a separate family bathroom.\r\n*  Ground-floor multipurpose room and bathroom - ideal for a home office, guest space, media room or additional living area.\r\n*  Lock-up-and-leave convenience - less maintenance, more freedom to travel, explore or enjoy your weekends.\r\n*  10-year Stamford building warranty - added peace of mind, subject to the remaining warranty period and policy conditions.\r\n\r\nWalk. Bike. Train. Beach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Eastern Bays lifestyle, from waterfront walks and weekend beach visits to local cafes, cycle routes and convenient transport connections to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nIt's a location that makes everyday living easier, while keeping the things you enjoy close by.\r\n\r\nThe developer is moving on to the next project, and with limited homes remaining, there's good reason to act now. There's still time to make 52C Tautari Street your new address before Christmas.\r\n\r\nCome and discover the quality, space, lifestyle and sense of community at Okahu Villas.\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised. Private viewings welcome.\r\n\r\nKristy Chen | 020 4149 0233  \r\nAngelina Vihrova | 021 727 751\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome.",
